### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`.
  Fields: ingredients, portionDivisor, labelName, dimensions, highlightedNutrients,
  instructions, variables, **servingHousehold, addedSugarsG, transFatG**, currentRecipeId, viewingVersionId.
  Actions: add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams)/updatePortion (preserves grams)/
  moveIngredient; setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/setHighlightedNutrients;
  setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG/setTransFatG;
  step add/update/remove/move; variable add/set/update/remove;
  clearRecipe/loadRecipe/loadVersion/exitVersionView/setCurrentRecipeId.
  Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows; `stateFromVersion` shared by loadRecipe/loadVersion.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; **max 50 recipes × 20 versions**.
  `RecipeSnapshot` includes label-meta overrides. Actions: `createRecipe/appendVersion/renameRecipe/deleteRecipe/deleteVersion`. Legacy flat snapshots migrate on hydrate.
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded`.
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props. Re-exports `THEME_DEFS`, `THEME_ORDER`, types.

### Hooks (frontend/src/hooks)
- `useNutritionCalc` — memoized live `MacroProfile` from current recipe (unrounded).
- `useIngredientSearch` — React Query, 300ms debounce, staleTime 30s, enabled ≥2 chars.
- `useDebounce<T>` — generic value debounce.
- `useLabelResize` — pointer-drag width handle, 96px/in, clamps 200–600px (≈2.08–6.25in).
- `useLabelSave` — encapsulates save/version workflow: builds `RecipeSnapshot` from recipeStore, formats relative time, `handleSaveVersion` (append-to-current-or-create-new), `handleSaveAsNew`, transient `"SAVED ✓"` feedback. Returns `canSave/isLoaded/versionCount/lastSavedRel/savedRecipeName/feedback`.
- `useAnimatedNumber` — rAF tween, default 420ms, cubic ease-out.
- `useRecipeActions` — `useShallow` slice of recipeStore action handles.
- `usePageMeta` — sets title + meta/canonical on route mount.
- `useAdSenseBootstrap` — script injection, no-op when disabled in `config/adsense.ts`.
- `useTitleAutoResize` — auto-grow `<textarea>` for the label name.
